The '''Bingo Heirloom''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Accessory]]. It is unobtainable.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingo Heirloom''' is unobtainable: however, it is implied to be purchasable from {{NPCSprite|Bingo (NPC);Bingo}} in a future update.

== Trivia ==
* The '''Bingo Heirloom''' was the first accessory added in-game to have the '''Heirloom''' suffix.
** However, due to being inaccessible, the first ''obtainable'' accessory with the '''Heirloom''' suffix is the {{Item|Crux Heirloom}} and the first ''obtainable'' accessory outside the [[Rift Dimension]] with the '''Heirloom''' suffix is the {{Item|Freshly Baked Heirloom}}.

